    // (new ArrayList<Long>(Arrays.asList((long)2l, (long)1l)))
    // Explanation: 2 has the smallest even value, and 2 has the smallest index.
    // Example 3:
    // >>> pluck((new ArrayList<Long>(Arrays.asList())))
    // (new ArrayList<Long>(Arrays.asList()))
    // Example 4:
